{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">KBLABEL function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309910","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/KBLABEL-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/KBLABEL-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"KBLABEL-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">KBLABEL function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the keyboard label (such as <strong class=\"ph b keylabel\">F1</strong>) of the key that performs a\nspecified ABL function (such as GO). </p>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> Does\nnot apply to SpeedScript programming.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"KBLABEL-function__syntax_GC18S92695552\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d453874e102\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"KBLABEL-function__idGDM2K22672054\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>KBLABEL ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">key-function</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">key-function</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An expression whose value is the name of the special ABL key function. See\n              <cite class=\"cite\">OpenEdge Development: Programming Interfaces</cite> for possible values of\n              <var class=\"keyword varname\">key-name</var>. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">key-function</var> is a constant, enclose\n            it in quotation marks (&quot;&quot;). See the same chapter for a list of key functions and the\n            corresponding standard keyboard keys.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"KBLABEL-function__example_GC18SA2695562\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d453874e155\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">The <span class=\"ph filepath\">r-kblabl.p</span> procedure\nallows the user to update some of the fields in each of the customer\nrecords, and displays a message in the status message area at the\nbottom of the window:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-kblabl.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"KBLABEL-function__idGDM2K32672060\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>STATUS INPUT &quot;Enter data, then press &quot; + <strong class=\"ph b\">KBLABEL(&quot;GO&quot;).</strong>\nFOR EACH Customer:\n  UPDATE Customer.CustNum Customer.Name Customer.Address Customer.City \n    Customer.State.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"KBLABEL-function__note_GC18SB2695570\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d453874e196\">Note</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">If you\nreassign a new function key for the key function with the ON statement,\nthe KBLABEL function returns the new key.</p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ISO-DATE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ISO-DATE-function.html\">ISO-DATE function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"KEYCODE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/KEYCODE-function.html\">KEYCODE function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309910","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"KBLABEL function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/KBLABEL-function.html","type":"Manual"}